der\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and 85 / 80 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and 85 /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.90<br/>December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Krailos Spider Lair</b> is a relative large cave found in southern <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33686,31744,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Krailos (33686, 31744, 7)</a>. The upper level is swarming with both <a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\">Wailing Widows</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug\">Brimstone Bugs</a> while the second level also has <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p>As these are all creatures available as tasks for the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>, this cave might form a nice opportunity if you decide to take them all at the same time. Just remember to bring a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bronze%20Amulet\">Bronze Amulet</a> to protect against the <a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug\">Brimstone Bugs</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Drain\">Mana Drain</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\">Wailing Widows</a> can cause drunkenness.\n</p><p>The Krailos Spider Lair is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Varying%20Monster%20Spawn\">Varying Monster Spawn</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Wailing Widow Cave</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\"><img alt=\"Wailing Widow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wailing_Widow_8ea655.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\">Wailing Widow</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">450</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">850</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">230</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-140× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Widow's Mandibles (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Halberd\">Halberd</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Plate Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Halberd\">Zaoan Halberd</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow%27s%20Necklace\">Wailing Widow's Necklace</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug\"><img alt=\"Brimstone Bug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"41\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brimstone_Bug_d2b40d.gif\" width=\"43\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug\">Brimstone Bug</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">420+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-200× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Poisonous Slime (common)</li>\n<li>Lump of Earth (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sulphurous%20Stone\">Sulphurous Stone</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Shell\">Brimstone Shell</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Brimstone Fangs (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Sulphur\">Magic Sulphur</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Amulet\">Platinum Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" ty